{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792075980, "covers_from": "2026-10-15T14:53:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-15T14:54:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792076040, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-15T14:53:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 31313, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "餐廳的垃圾沒落實垃圾不落地，容易造成環境髒亂／鼠患。這麼進步的台北市，路邊垃圾桶都不見了？為什麼？", "display_name": "中山代表 No.31,313", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T14:53:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 20924, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "家裡重新裝潢了10幾年，兩個月前第一次出現老鼠，崩潰！", "display_name": "松山代表 No.20,924", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T14:53:24+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 58048, "sprite_key": "deer_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "文化", "content": "一條生養台北的\n瑠公圳\n至今肝腸寸斷\n能不能改頭換面成為台北京都的哲學之道", "display_name": "信義代表 No.58,048", "mood": "positive", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T14:53:36+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 9103, "sprite_key": "beaver_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "都更遲遲沒有推進，同時發展高房價，居住正義如何實現？", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.9,103", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-15T14:53:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 53781, "sprite_key": "bear_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "經濟", "content": "我是北漂人，我很想要喜歡台北，未來也會長居台北成為台北人，但台北房租實在太他媽貴了", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.53,781", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 20924, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.20,924", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 58048, "sprite_key": "deer_business", "display_name": "信義代表 No.58,048", "district": "xinyi", "is